| **Medium** | Both configs share identical default SHR=0.75, but room ACs should be 0.65–0.75 |
| **Medium** | Central AC Cd=0.07 (SEER≥13) under-predicts cycling losses vs EnergyPlus Cd=0.20–0.25 |
| **Medium** | RoomAcConfig has no multi-speed support — can't model inverter window ACs |
| **Low** | RoomAcConfig doesn't validate `startup_cd` |
| **Low** | RoomAcConfig lacks `charge_defect_ratio` field |
| Info | Default biquadratic curves correctly differ between room/central AC |
| Info | Airflow constants correctly computed: 400 CFM/ton (central) vs 320 CFM/ton (room) |
| Info | Compressor speed → PLF model association is architecturally sound |
